        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Got my car tinted here and I’m really happy with the result! The team is professional, friendly, and easy to communicate with. The price vs value is excellent — you really get great quality for what you pay. Highly recommend them!",
